<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich sees double-digit profit growth.</title>
<headline>Zurich sees double-digit profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Zurich Group said it was confident that profits would show a double-digit rise in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;A good result must be double digit growth...I can't say more, but I am confident that we will have a good result (in 1997),&quot; Zurich's chairman Rolf Hueppi told a news conference.</p>
<p>Hueppi made the comment when asked to be more specific with regard to the company's 1997 profit outlook.</p>
<p>Zurich Group reported a 30 percent rise in 1996 net profit to 1.138 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
